00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:07.109
- So, my question is, do you prefer to be

00:09:07.109 --> 00:09:09.194
around people who are the same as you are

00:09:09.194 --> 00:09:10.821
or who are different from you?

00:09:10.821 --> 00:09:12.072
- Oh, that's a good question.

00:09:13.323 --> 00:09:14.825
Same or different?

00:09:16.076 --> 00:09:18.620
You know, it's interesting,
I had an interesting moment

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:22.040
